PURPOSE

Test whether Yggdrasil can become a language-model substrate: sequence state, next-symbol prediction, delayed copy, associative recall, binding, nesting, synthetic grammar, then byte/token prediction.

IMMEDIATE FRONTIER

First scientific frontier after bootstrap: a minimal sequence-learning diagnostic that measures whether distributed state carries predictive information across time before introducing a larger language-training regime.

